scn 1
# Five Drakes (Crusades) standing in one cell fight-moved, one click each, to one far point: each flies
# VTOL_Move (no spread for a lone unit), and past stage 0 its air-traffic check (417d4e) steps it out of the
# stack it starts in and of the one it meets at the point (VTOL_StepOut, 4214b0). Without a mission (through
# protocol 307's first cut) the five flew the whole leg as one stack.
name air-stack-fight-cell
ticks 1500
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
group d1 0 drake 1 cells 20,80
group d2 0 drake 1 cells 20,80
group d3 0 drake 1 cells 20,80
group d4 0 drake 1 cells 20,80
group d5 0 drake 1 cells 20,80
at 2 fight d1 1900 1300
at 2 fight d2 1900 1300
at 2 fight d3 1900 1300
at 2 fight d4 1900 1300
at 2 fight d5 1900 1300
pair stack d* d* cells=2
